    {
      "id": "line-1",
      "path": ".media/audio/voice/line-1.wav",
      "duration_s": 5.50312925170068,
      "original_text": "Does every message from your laptop need the router? Watch these two devices.",
      "spoken_text": "Does every message from your laptop need the router? Watch these two devices.",
      "normalization_fingerprint": "d2aad78b8b4acf1902269a003e5019fb63371d3f69137e6cbbf26e47f361daab",
      "frame": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "line-2",
      "path": ".media/audio/voice/line-2.wav",
      "duration_s": 8.568163265306122,
      "original_text": "Here, both addresses use a slash twenty-four prefix. Their network portions match, even though the devices have different numbers.",
      "spoken_text": "Here, both addresses use a slash twenty-four prefix. Their network portions match, even though the devices have different numbers.",
      "normalization_fingerprint": "d2aad78b8b4acf1902269a003e5019fb63371d3f69137e6cbbf26e47f361daab",
      "frame": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "line-3",
      "path": ".media/audio/voice/line-3.wav",
      "duration_s": 6.130068027210885,
      "original_text": "The destination is local. The laptop sends the packet through the switch to the other device.",
      "spoken_text": "The destination is local. The laptop sends the packet through the switch to the other device.",
      "normalization_fingerprint": "d2aad78b8b4acf1902269a003e5019fb63371d3f69137e6cbbf26e47f361daab",
      "frame": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "line-4",
      "path": ".media/audio/voice/line-4.wav",
      "duration_s": 7.1053061224489795,
      "original_text": "Now change the destination's network. Those highlighted portions no longer match. The destination is remote.",
      "spoken_text": "Now change the destination's network. Those highlighted portions no longer match. The destination is remote.",
      "normalization_fingerprint": "d2aad78b8b4acf1902269a003e5019fb63371d3f69137e6cbbf26e47f361daab",
      "frame": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "line-5",
      "path": ".media/audio/voice/line-5.wav",
      "duration_s": 5.572789115646258,
      "original_text": "In this simple setup, remote traffic goes to the default gateway: the router.",
      "spoken_text": "In this simple setup, remote traffic goes to the default gateway: the router.",
      "normalization_fingerprint": "d2aad78b8b4acf1902269a003e5019fb63371d3f69137e6cbbf26e47f361daab",
      "frame": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "line-6",
      "path": ".media/audio/voice/line-6.wav",
      "duration_s": 5.921088435374149,
      "original_text": "The router forwards the packet toward the other network, where it can reach the destination.",
      "spoken_text": "The router forwards the packet toward the other network, where it can reach the destination.",
      "normalization_fingerprint": "d2aad78b8b4acf1902269a003e5019fb63371d3f69137e6cbbf26e47f361daab",
      "frame": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "line-7",
      "path": ".media/audio/voice/line-7.wav",
      "duration_s": 7.1053061224489795,
      "original_text": "Same subnet: local delivery. Different subnet: use a router. That is the decision to remember.",
      "spoken_text": "Same subnet: local delivery. Different subnet: use a router. That is the decision to remember.",
      "normalization_fingerprint": "d2aad78b8b4acf1902269a003e5019fb63371d3f69137e6cbbf26e47f361daab",
      "frame": 7
    }
  ],
